5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who sits beside whom. It shapes our daily connection.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current layout feels arbitrary. We should define the criteria first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am unsure. I just want a quiet place to work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My schedule is tight. I need to know how much time moving takes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Comfort is invisible but critical. We must measure it, not guess.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, yes. Let us look at the survey and the sound levels.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I will check the billing basis and the past shuffles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the floor billing and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I need the arrival times and the physio note. Time is money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the sound meter readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, your time is valuable. I hope the data helps you.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, sound is a fair metric. Let us see what the numbers say.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the costs are clear. It is hard to ask for more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the transition period. It feels chaotic already.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Data removes emotion. Let us trust the measurements over opinions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
