35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The survey shows daylight matters. The pilot floor takes up to nine minutes to settle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The billing is by area, not heads. We pay for empty desks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The quote is 6,200 yen per desk. Every change costs again.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,The badge log shows a nine-minute gap before the room is full.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The window side is nine decibels quieter. The physio says chairs take days to settle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, nine decibels is a lot. I feel that in my bones.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, so we should not move desks lightly. The cost is real.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yes. I was afraid of that. It is a lot of money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, days to settle? That eats my gaps. I cannot wait.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the quiet side is worth the wait. Your gaps are short, but so is the noise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I think we should keep the window desks for those who need quiet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. But we must say who gets them. Not by habit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I would take the quiet side. I am sorry. I am just tired.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,I need a desk that is ready on day one. No settling.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Then we assign by need, not by arrival. The data supports it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, let us propose a rule. Quiet for those who need it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will draft it. We name the trade-off out loud.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you. I do not know how to ask for this.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I will accept the rule if it protects my mornings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Good. The plan is clear. Let us vote.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
